#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhanced SCAP Auditing (Beta)"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ SCAP ແບບປັບປຸງໃໝ່ (Beta)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} introduces a modernized approach to SCAP (Security Content "
"Automation Protocol) auditing, available as a beta feature.  The enhanced "
"SCAP integration streamlines compliance scanning by centralizing content "
"management, introducing reusable policies, supporting automated remediation, "
"and eliminating the need to pre-stage SCAP files on managed systems."
msgstr "{productname} ແນະນຳແນວທາງການກວດສອບ SCAP (Security Content Automation Protocol) ແບບທັນສະໄໝ, ເຊິ່ງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນຟີເຈີເບຕ້າ (Beta). ການລວມ SCAP ແບບປັບປຸງໃໝ່ນີ້ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສະແກນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງ (Compliance scanning) ເປັນໄປຢ່າງຄ່ອງຕົວ ໂດຍການຈັດການເນື້ອຫາແບບລວມສູນ, ການນຳໃຊ້ນະໂຍບາຍທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຊໍ້າໄດ້, ການຮອງຮັບການແກ້ໄຂແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການກຽມໄຟລ໌ SCAP ໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນລະບົບທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ການຈັດການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This feature is currently in **beta**.  You must enable the beta feature "
"flag in your user preferences before using it."
msgstr "ຟີເຈີນີ້ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະ **beta** ໃນປະຈຸບັນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Beta feature flag ໃນສ່ວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ (User preferences) ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable the beta feature"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟີເຈີເບຕ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:6
msgid "To access the enhanced SCAP auditing features:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຟີເຈີການກວດສອບ SCAP ແບບປັບປຸງໃໝ່:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling the beta feature"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດເບຕ້າ (Beta)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:8
msgid "Navigate to menu:Home[User Account > My Preferences]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Home[User Account > My Preferences]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:9
msgid "Check the btn:[Enable Beta Features] checkbox."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ກ່ອງໝາຍ btn:[Enable Beta Features]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:26
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:46
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:78
msgid "Click btn:[Submit]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Submit]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Once enabled, additional menu entries appear under menu:Audit[OpenSCAP], and "
"the scan scheduling interface is replaced with the new beta UI."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ, ຈະມີລາຍການເມນູເພີ່ມເຕີມປະກົດຂຶ້ນພາຍໃຕ້ menu:Audit[OpenSCAP], ແລະ ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແທນດ້ວຍ UI ແບບເບຕ້າໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The beta feature flag is a per-user setting.  Each user who wants to use the "
"enhanced SCAP features must enable it individually."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດເບຕ້ານີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະບຸກຄົນ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນທີ່ຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ ຄຸນສົມບັດ SCAP ແບບປັບປຸງໃໝ່ ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key differences from legacy SCAP integration"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ສຳຄັນຈາກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SCAP ແບບເກົ່າ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Legacy integration\n"
"| Enhanced integration (beta)\n"
"\n"
"| SCAP content files must exist on the managed system beforehand\n"
"| SCAP content is transferred automatically from the server to the managed "
"system at scan time\n"
"\n"
"| No centralized content management\n"
"| Upload and manage SCAP content centrally via the {webui}\n"
"\n"
"| No tailoring file management\n"
"| Dedicated UI for uploading and managing tailoring files\n"
"\n"
"| Scans are configured individually each time\n"
"| Reusable SCAP policies combine content, profiles, and tailoring files\n"
"\n"
"| No built-in remediation\n"
"| Apply remediation directly from scan results, or define custom remediation "
"scripts\n"
"\n"
"| No recurring scan support tied to policies\n"
"| Schedule recurring scans linked to policies for ongoing compliance "
"tracking\n"
msgstr ""
"| ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບເກົ່າ (Legacy)\n"
"| ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບປັບປຸງໃໝ່ (Beta)\n"
"\n"
"| ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການມາກ່ອນແລ້ວ\n"
"| ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຈາກເຊີເວີໄປຫາລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເວລາທີ່ກວດສອບ\n"
"\n"
"| ບໍ່ມີການຈັດການເນື້ອຫາແບບລວມສູນ\n"
"| ອັບໂຫຼດ ແລະ ຈັດການເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ແບບລວມສູນຜ່ານ {webui}\n"
"\n"
"| ບໍ່ມີການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ (Tailoring file)\n"
"| ມີ UI ສະເພາະສຳລັບການອັບໂຫຼດ ແລະ ຈັດການໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ\n"
"\n"
"| ການກວດສອບຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ແຍກກັນໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ\n"
"| ນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP ທີ່ໃຊ້ຄືນໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາທັງເນື້ອຫາ, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ\n"
"\n"
"| ບໍ່ມີລະບົບການແກ້ໄຂ (Remediation) ໃນຕົວ\n"
"| ນຳໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກຜົນການກວດສອບ ຫຼື ກຳນົດສະຄຣິບແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ\n"
"\n"
"| ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການກວດສອບແບບເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບນະໂຍບາຍ\n"
"| ກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບແບບເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບນະໂຍບາຍ ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP content management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການເນື້ອຫາ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:16
msgid ""
"SCAP content files (DataStream and XCCDF) can be uploaded and managed "
"centrally on the {productname} server."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP (DataStream ແລະ XCCDF) ສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດ ແລະ ຈັດການແບບລວມສູນໄດ້ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload SCAP content"
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດເນື້ອຫາ SCAP"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading SCAP content"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບໂຫຼດເນື້ອຫາ SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:19
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:44
msgid "Provide a **Name** and optional **Description**."
msgstr "ລະບຸ **ຊື່** ແລະ **ຄຳອະທິບາຍ** (ຖ້າມີ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:22
msgid "Upload the files:"
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "**DataStream file**: The filename must end with `-ds.xml`.\n"
msgstr "**ໄຟລ໌ DataStream**: ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ `-ds.xml`.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "**XCCDF file**: The filename must end with `-xccdf.xml`.\n"
msgstr "**ໄຟລ໌ XCCDF**: ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ `-xccdf.xml`.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Both files must share the same base name (for example, `ssg-sle15-ds.xml` "
"and `ssg-sle15-xccdf.xml`)."
msgstr "ທັງສອງໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຊື່ພື້ນຖານອັນດຽວກັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `ssg-sle15-ds.xml` ແລະ `ssg-sle15-xccdf.xml`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Uploaded files are stored on the server at "
"[path]``/srv/susemanager/scap/ssg/content/``."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດແລ້ວຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ [path]``/srv/susemanager/scap/ssg/content/``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit and delete SCAP content"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບເນື້ອຫາ SCAP"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing and deleting SCAP content"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບເນື້ອຫາ SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:30
msgid "Go to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Click a content entry to edit its name, description, or replace the uploaded "
"files."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ລາຍການເນື້ອຫາເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຊື່, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແທນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:32
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:52
msgid "Select one or more entries and click btn:[Delete] to remove them."
msgstr "ເລືອກໜຶ່ງລາຍການ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍລາຍການ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Delete] ເພື່ອລຶບອອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Deleting SCAP content that is referenced by a policy will break that "
"policy.  Ensure no active policies depend on the content before deleting it."
msgstr "ການລຶບເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ທີ່ຖືກອ້າງອີງໂດຍນະໂຍບາຍໃດໜຶ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ນະໂຍບາຍນັ້ນໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີນະໂຍບາຍໃດທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ອາໄສເນື້ອຫານີ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະທຳການລຶບ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Due to the large size of OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language) "
"files, they are not transferred automatically from the server to the managed "
"system.  If your SCAP evaluation requires OVAL files, you must ensure they "
"are already present on the managed system before scheduling the scan."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກໄຟລ໌ OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language) ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຈາກເຊີເວີໄປຫາລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າການປະເມີນ SCAP ຂອງທ່ານ ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ OVAL, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການແລ້ວ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:36
msgid "You can specify OVAL file paths when creating a SCAP policy."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ OVAL ໄດ້ໃນເວລາສ້າງນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tailoring file management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ (Tailoring file)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:38
msgid ""
"SCAP tailoring files allow you to customize the behavior of an SCAP profile "
"without modifying the original content.  The enhanced integration provides a "
"dedicated interface for managing tailoring files."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ SCAP ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ SCAP ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂເນື້ອຫາຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບປັບປຸງໃໝ່ນີ້ມີສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະສຳລັບການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Tailoring files are scoped per organization.  Each organization manages its "
"own set of tailoring files independently."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງຈະຖືກກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຕາມອົງກອນ. ແຕ່ລະອົງກອນຈະຈັດການຊຸດໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງຂອງຕົນເອງຢ່າງເປັນເອກະລາດ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload a tailoring file"
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading a tailoring file"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:42
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:45
msgid "Upload the tailoring file (XML format)."
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ (ຮູບແບບ XML)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Tailoring files are stored on the server at "
"[path]``/srv/susemanager/scap/tailoring-files/``."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ [path]``/srv/susemanager/scap/tailoring-files/``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Editing and deleting tailoring files"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Edit and delete tailoring files"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:50
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files] list."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ລາຍການເມນູ:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Click a tailoring file entry to edit its name, description, or replace the "
"file."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ລາຍການໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຊື່, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແທນໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP policies"
msgstr "ນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:54
msgid ""
"SCAP policies define a reusable combination of SCAP content, a specific "
"profile, and an optional tailoring file.  Policies simplify the process of "
"scheduling consistent compliance scans across your infrastructure."
msgstr "ນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP ກຳນົດການລວມກັນຂອງເນື້ອຫາ SCAP, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສະເພາະ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ (ຖ້າມີ) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ຄືນໄດ້. ນະໂຍບາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງໃນທົ່ວໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານເປັນໄປຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ ແລະ ງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a policy"
msgstr "ການສ້າງນະໂຍບາຍ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a policy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງນະໂຍບາຍ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:57
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:59
msgid "Fill in the policy details:"
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງນະໂຍບາຍ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Policy Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ນະໂຍບາຍ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:61
msgid "A unique name for the policy within your organization."
msgstr "ຊື່ນະໂຍບາຍທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:63
msgid "An optional description of the policy's purpose."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບຈຸດປະສົງຂອງນະໂຍບາຍ (ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP Content"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນ SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:65
msgid "Select from the uploaded SCAP content."
msgstr "ເລືອກຈາກເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ທີ່ໄດ້ອັບໂຫຼດໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "XCCDF Profile"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ XCCDF"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Select a profile from the chosen SCAP content. The list of available "
"profiles is loaded dynamically from the content file."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈາກເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້. ລາຍການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກດຶງມາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tailoring File"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ (Tailoring File)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:69
msgid "(Optional) Select a tailoring file to customize the selected profile."
msgstr "(ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ) ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tailoring Profile"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:71
msgid ""
"(Optional) If a tailoring file is selected, choose a profile from the "
"tailoring file."
msgstr "(ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ) ຖ້າມີການເລືອກໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈາກໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL Files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ OVAL"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:73
msgid ""
"(Optional) Comma-separated list of OVAL file paths that must exist on the "
"managed system."
msgstr "(ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ) ລາຍຊື່ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ OVAL ທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced Arguments"
msgstr "ອາຣກິວເມັນຂັ້ນສູງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:75
msgid ""
"(Optional) Additional `oscap` command-line arguments (for example, "
"`--fetch-remote-resources`)."
msgstr "(ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ) ອາຣກິວເມັນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ `oscap` (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `--fetch-remote-resources`)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch Remote Resources"
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກແຫຼ່ງພາຍນອກ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:77
msgid ""
"(Optional) Enable to allow `oscap` to download remote XCCDF resources during "
"evaluation."
msgstr "(ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ) ເປີດໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອໃຫ້ `oscap` ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ XCCDF ຈາກທາງໄກໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະເມີນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Policy details and scan history"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດນະໂຍບາຍ ແລະ ປະຫວັດການກວດສອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:80
msgid "Click on a policy name in the list to view its details, including:"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ນະໂຍບາຍໃນລາຍການເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ, ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:81
msgid "The associated SCAP content, profile, and tailoring file."
msgstr "ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:82
msgid ""
"A scan history showing all scans that were executed using this policy, with "
"compliance results."
msgstr "ປະຫວັດການກວດສອບທີ່ສະແດງການກວດສອບທັງໝົດທີ່ໄດ້ປະຕິບັດໂດຍໃຊ້ນະໂຍບາຍນີ້, ພ້ອມກັບຜົນຂອງຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit and delete policies"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບນະໂຍບາຍ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing and deleting policies"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບນະໂຍບາຍ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:85
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies] list."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ລາຍການເມນູ:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:86
msgid "Click the edit icon to modify a policy."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງນະໂຍບາຍ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:87
msgid "Select one or more policies and click btn:[Delete] to remove them."
msgstr "ເລືອກໜຶ່ງນະໂຍບາຍ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍນະໂຍບາຍ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Delete] ເພື່ອລຶບອອກ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schedule SCAP scans"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບ SCAP"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scheduling a scan for a single system"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບສຳລັບລະບົບດຽວ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling a scan for a single system"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບສຳລັບລະບົບດຽວ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:91
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Details > Audit > OpenSCAP > Schedule]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[System Details > Audit > OpenSCAP > Schedule]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:92
msgid "Select a **SCAP Policy** to use for the scan."
msgstr "ເລືອກ **ນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP** ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:93
msgid "Choose the scan schedule:"
msgstr "ເລືອກກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Run now**: Execute the scan immediately.\n"
msgstr "**Run now**: ເລີ່ມການກວດສອບທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Schedule for later**: Pick a specific date and time.\n"
msgstr "**Schedule for later**: ເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schedule scans for multiple systems (SSM)"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບສຳລັບຫຼາຍລະບົບ (SSM)"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling scans for multiple systems (SSM)"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບສຳລັບຫຼາຍລະບົບ (SSM)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:99
msgid "Add the target systems to the System Set Manager (SSM)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍເຂົ້າໃນ System Set Manager (SSM)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:100
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Audit > Schedule]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[System Set Manager > Audit > Schedule]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:101
msgid "Select a **SCAP Policy**."
msgstr "ເລືອກ **ນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP**."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:102
msgid "Choose the scan schedule."
msgstr "ເລືອກກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring scans"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບແບບເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:105
msgid ""
"SCAP policies can be scheduled as recurring actions, enabling automated "
"compliance monitoring."
msgstr "ນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP ສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາໃຫ້ເປັນການດຳເນີນການແບບເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:106
msgid "To set up a recurring scan, run the procedure:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການກວດສອບແບບເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up a recurring scan"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການກວດສອບແບບເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Navigate to the recurring actions configuration for a system or system "
"group."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການດຳເນີນການແບບເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ (recurring actions) ສຳລັບລະບົບ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:109
msgid "Select **SCAP Policy Scan** as the action type."
msgstr "ເລືອກ **SCAP Policy Scan** ເປັນປະເພດຂອງການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:110
msgid "Choose the SCAP policy to apply."
msgstr "ເລືອກນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:111
msgid "Configure the recurrence schedule (for example, daily, weekly)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງການເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທຸກມື້, ທຸກອາທິດ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:112
msgid ""
"Optionally enable **Test Mode** to simulate the scan without applying "
"changes."
msgstr "ສາມາດເລືອກເປີດໃຊ້ **Test Mode** ເພື່ອຈຳລອງການກວດສອບໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:113
msgid ""
"Recurring scans are linked to the selected SCAP policy.  If you update the "
"policy (for example, change the profile), future recurring scans will use "
"the updated configuration."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບແບບເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບນະໂຍບາຍ SCAP ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້. ຖ້າທ່ານມີການອັບເດດນະໂຍບາຍ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ປ່ຽນໂປຣໄຟລ໌), ການກວດສອບໃນອະນາຄົດຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ທີ່ໄດ້ອັບເດດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "How scans work"
msgstr "ວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການກວດສອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:115
msgid "When a scan is scheduled with the enhanced (beta) SCAP integration:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອການກວດສອບຖືກກຳນົດເວລາດ້ວຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SCAP ແບບປັບປຸງໃໝ່ (ເບຕ້າ):"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:116
msgid ""
"The {productname} server transfers the required SCAP content files "
"(DataStream and XCCDF) from the server to the managed system using Salt's "
"file management."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (DataStream ແລະ XCCDF) ຈາກເຊີເວີ ໄປຫາລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຂອງ Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:117
msgid "If a tailoring file is associated with the policy, it is also transferred."
msgstr "ຖ້ານະໂຍບາຍມີໄຟລ໌ປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນກໍຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:118
msgid ""
"The `oscap` tool is executed on the managed system with the appropriate "
"parameters (profile, rules, tailoring, etc.)."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື `oscap` ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດງານໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ເໝາະສົມ (ໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ກົດລະບຽບ, ການປັບແຕ່ງ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:119
msgid ""
"Scan results (`results.xml` and `report.html`) are collected from the "
"managed system and stored on the server."
msgstr "ຜົນການກວດສອບ (`results.xml` ແລະ `report.html`) ຈະຖືກເກັບກຳຈາກລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:120
msgid ""
"Results are available for review in the WebUI under the system's audit "
"section."
msgstr "ຜົນການກວດສອບສາມາດເຂົ້າເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ WebUI ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນການກວດສອບ (audit) ຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:121
msgid ""
"Files are transferred to [path]``/var/cache/salt/minion/scap/`` on the "
"managed system."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປທີ່ [path]``/var/cache/salt/minion/scap/`` ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:122
msgid ""
"OVAL files are **not** transferred automatically due to their large size.  "
"If your scan requires OVAL files, they must be present on the managed system "
"before the scan runs."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ OVAL ຈະ **ບໍ່** ຖືກສົ່ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເນື່ອງຈາກມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່. ຖ້າການກວດສອບຂອງທ່ານ ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ OVAL, ພວກມັນຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການກ່ອນທີ່ການກວດສອບຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:123
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ (Remediation)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:124
msgid ""
"The enhanced SCAP integration allows you to apply remediation actions "
"directly from scan results to fix non-compliant rules."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SCAP ແບບປັບປຸງໃໝ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການດຳເນີນການແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກຜົນການກວດສອບ ເພື່ອປັບປຸງກົດລະບຽບທີ່ບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation from scan results"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂຈາກຜົນການກວດສອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:126
msgid ""
"After reviewing scan results, you can apply remediation for individual rules "
"that have failed."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກວດສອບຜົນການກວດສອບແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບແຕ່ລະກົດລະບຽບທີ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying remediation from scan results"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂຈາກຜົນການກວດສອບ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:128
msgid "Navigate to a completed scan's results."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ຜົນການກວດສອບທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:129
msgid "Identify the non-compliant rule."
msgstr "ລະບຸກົດລະບຽບທີ່ບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:130
msgid "Click the remediation action to apply the fix."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ການດຳເນີນການແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເລີ່ມການປັບປຸງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:131
msgid "Remediation can be applied in two ways:"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນສອງວິທີ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bash remediation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍ Bash"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:133
msgid ""
"A shell script is executed on the managed system as root.  The script is "
"derived from the SCAP content's built-in fix elements."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ shell ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດງານໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໃນຖານະ root. ສະຄຣິບນີ້ແມ່ນ ມາຈາກອົງປະກອບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຕົວຂອງເນື້ອຫາ SCAP."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt remediation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:135
msgid ""
"A {salt} state is applied to the managed system.  This uses the "
"`scap_beta.remediation` {salt} state with the remediation content passed as "
"pillar data."
msgstr "ສະຖານະ (state) ຂອງ {salt} ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ `scap_beta.remediation` ໂດຍສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາການແກ້ໄຂເປັນຂໍ້ມູນ pillar."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom remediation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:137
msgid ""
"If the built-in remediation from the SCAP content is insufficient or you "
"need to tailor the fix for your environment, you can define custom "
"remediation scripts."
msgstr "ຫາກການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ຍັງບໍ່ພຽງພໍ ຫຼື ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງການແກ້ໄຂ ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດສະຄຣິບການແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:138
msgid "Custom remediation is scoped per organization and per rule."
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງຈະຖືກກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຕາມອົງກອນ ແລະ ຕາມແຕ່ລະກົດລະບຽບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:139
msgid "To save a custom remediation, follow these steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Saving a custom remediation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການບັນທຶກການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:141
msgid "Navigate to the rule's remediation view."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າການແກ້ໄຂຂອງກົດລະບຽບນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:142
msgid "Choose the script type:"
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງສະຄຣິບ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Bash**: A custom shell script.\n"
msgstr "**Bash**: ສະຄຣິບ shell ແບບກຳນົດເອງ.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Salt**: A custom Salt state definition.\n"
msgstr "**Salt**: ການກຳນົດສະຖານະ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງ.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:145
msgid "Enter or modify the remediation script."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:147
msgid ""
"Custom remediation overrides the default remediation from the SCAP content "
"for the specific rule within your organization."
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງຈະແທນທີ່ການແກ້ໄຂມາດຕະຖານຈາກເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ສຳລັບກົດລະບຽບນັ້ນໆ ພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:148
msgid ""
"Custom remediation includes an audit trail.  The system tracks which user "
"created and last modified each custom remediation script."
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງມີການຕິດຕາມຂໍ້ມູນການກວດສອບ. ລະບົບຈະບັນທຶກວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄົນໃດເປັນຜູ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບການແກ້ໄຂນັ້ນຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:149
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting custom remediation"
msgstr "ການລຶບການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:150
msgid ""
"You can delete a custom remediation to revert to the default remediation "
"provided by the SCAP content."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາລຶບການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບກັບໄປໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂມາດຕະຖານທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນເນື້ອຫາ SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:151
msgid ""
"Navigate to the custom remediation view and click btn:[Delete] for the "
"specific script type."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າການແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Delete] ສຳລັບປະເພດສະຄຣິບນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:152
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigation reference"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງການນຳທາງເມນູ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:153
