"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-standard.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:92
msgid ""
"You can run them using remote commands or with Ansible, after enabling "
"Ansible in the client system."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລັນພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ remote commands ຫຼື ໃຊ້ Ansible, ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ Ansible ໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run remediation using a Bash script"
msgstr "ລັນການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ Bash"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:94
msgid ""
"Install the [package]``scap-security-guide`` package on all your target "
"systems.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ໃນທຸກໆລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:95
msgid ""
"Packages, channels and scripts are different for each operating system and "
"distribution.  Examples are listed in the <<scripts-for-os-types>> section."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ, ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ແລະ ສະຄຣິບ ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ດິສຕຣິບິວຊັນ (distribution). ຕົວຢ່າງຕ່າງໆແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນພາກສ່ວນ <<scripts-for-os-types>>."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Bash script on single systems as a remote command"
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບ Bash ໃນລະບົບດ່ຽວໃນຮູບແບບ remote command"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:97
msgid "Run the Bash script as a remote command on single systems."
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບ Bash ເປັນ remote command ໃນລະບົບດ່ຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:98
msgid ""
"From menu:System[Overview] tab, select your instance.  Then in "
"menu:Details[Remote Commands], write a Bash script such as:"
msgstr "ຈາກແທັບ menu:System[Overview], ເລືອກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງທ່ານ. ຈາກນັ້ນໃນ menu:Details[Remote Commands], ໃຫ້ຂຽນສະຄຣິບ Bash ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:99
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"chmod +x -R /usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"chmod +x -R /usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Folder and script names change between distribution and version.  Examples "
"are listed in the <<scripts-for-os-types>> section."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ຊື່ສະຄຣິບຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມດິສຕຣິບິວຊັນ ແລະ ເວີຊັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງຕ່າງໆແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນພາກສ່ວນ <<scripts-for-os-types>>."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the bash script using System Set Manager on multiple systems"
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບ Bash ໂດຍໃຊ້ System Set Manager ໃນຫຼາຍລະບົບພ້ອມກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:103
msgid "Run the Bash script as a remote command on multiple systems at once."
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບ Bash ເປັນ remote command ໃນຫຼາຍລະບົບພ້ອມກັນໃນເທື່ອດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:104
msgid ""
"When a system group has been created click [guimenu]``System Groups``, "
"select [guimenu]``Use in SSM`` from the table."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ [guimenu]``System Groups``, ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Use in SSM`` ຈາກຕາຕະລາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:105
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``System Set Manager``, under menu:Misc[Remote Command], "
"write a Bash script such as:"
msgstr "ຈາກ [guimenu]``System Set Manager``, ພາຍໃຕ້ menu:Misc[Remote Command], ໃຫ້ຂຽນສະຄຣິບ Bash ເຊັ່ນ:"

